          "answer": "Whether medication is the usual first step depends on the condition. For some conditions, doctors often start with lifestyle changes. For others, medicine is part of the first plan, and many conditions are treated with both. I can't give a specific answer yet because I don't know what you're asking about.\n\nWhich condition or symptom do you mean? It could be the sleep trouble you mentioned, or something else. Once I know, I can look up what the guidance says for that condition.\n\nI also need to correct my last message. It listed sources for asthma, diabetes, migraine, and other conditions that don't relate to your sleep question. I also said a tool-call limit stopped my search, but I can't confirm that from this conversation. Please don't rely on that source list. If you tell me the condition, I'll search again.\n\nNot medical advice. This is an educational software project. It does not diagnose or treat, and it must not be used for real medical decisions. Please don't start, stop, or change any medicine without talking to a clinician.",
